Versão 2
-======-

NOTE: This is only the main guitar part played by Thom Yorke.
Jonny Greenwood's part is played up an octave (courtesy of a capo),
and should be available from most other "Street Spirit" tabs. It is
basically a variant, less-intricate picking of the same chord shapes
of the main guitar part. I have no idea what Ed O'Brien does during
this song.

Street Spirit is based almost entirely upon three base chords
-- Am, Em and C. They are spiced up with ornamentations, and are played
 as follows:

