And that's it! Simple, yet mesmerising song. The only part that will be a stumble
is getting the E riff right, which requires a different fingering from the rest.
I play it with my index finger planted on the G-string, using my pinky and middle
finger to do the descending notes on the B-string. Finally, the middle finger moves
at the end to the D-string to get that E on the second fret. Sounds complicated,
but with practice, you'll get it. Enjoy!

